<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <%- include('../partials/head', { title: 'Help - Scriptorium' }) %>
    <style>

    /* ============================================================
       HELP PAGE
    ============================================================ */

    .bg-orb {
        position: fixed; border-radius: 50%;
        filter: blur(90px); pointer-events: none;
        z-index: 0; opacity: 0.15;
        animation: orbDrift 12s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    }
    .bg-orb-1 { width:500px; height:500px; background:#1a0f4c; top:-100px; left:-80px; }
    .bg-orb-2 { width:380px; height:380px; background:#00C49A; bottom:10%; right:-60px; animation-delay:-5s; }
    @keyframes orbDrift {
        from { transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }
        to   { transform: translateY(28px) scale(1.07); }
    }

    .help-wrap {
        max-width: 740px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 5rem;
    }

    /* Page header */
    .help-header {
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
        padding-bottom: 2rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    }
    .help-eyebrow {
        font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #00C49A; margin-bottom: 10px; display: block;
    }
    .help-title {
        font-size: 2.4rem; font-weight: 800;
        color: #fff; margin: 0 0 12px; line-height: 1.15;
        font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive;
    }
    .help-subtitle {
        font-size: 0.95rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
        line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;
        max-width: 540px;
    }

    /* Section */
    .help-section {
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        background: rgba(15,25,30,0.65);
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 28px 28px 24px;
        position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .help-section::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute; left: 0; top: 20px; bottom: 20px;
        width: 3px; border-radius: 0 3px 3px 0;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #00C49A, transparent);
    }

    .help-section-header {
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .help-section-icon {
        width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 10px;
        background: rgba(0,196,154,0.1);
        border: 1px solid rgba(0,196,154,0.2);
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        font-size: 1.1rem; flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .help-section-title {
        font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; margin: 0;
    }

    .help-body {
        font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
        line-height: 1.7; margin: 0;
    }
    .help-body p { margin: 0 0 10px; }
    .help-body p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .help-body strong { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); font-weight: 700; }
    .help-body .hl { color: #00C49A; font-weight: 700; }
    .help-body .hl-gold { color: #ffd54f; font-weight: 700; }

    /* Clickable spots list */
    .room-spots {
        list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 12px 0 0;
        display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;
    }
    .room-spot {
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
        border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 14px;
        font-size: 0.82rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    }
    .room-spot-icon {
        font-size: 1.1rem; flex-shrink: 0; width: 24px; text-align: center;
    }
    .room-spot-arrow {
        margin-left: auto;
        font-size: 0.7rem; color: rgba(0,196,154,0.5);
        font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }

    /* Yarn table */
    .yarn-table {
        width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 12px;
    }
    .yarn-table td {
        padding: 8px 0; font-size: 0.82rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    }
    .yarn-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
    .yarn-table td:first-child { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); }
    .yarn-table td:last-child {
        text-align: right;
        color: #ffd54f; font-weight: 700;
    }

    /* Back link */
    .btn-back {
        display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;
        padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 999px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
        font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 500;
        text-decoration: none; margin-bottom: 2rem;
        transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-back:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); color: #fff; transform: translateX(-2px); }
    .btn-back svg { width: 13px; height: 13px; }

    </style>
</head>
<body style="background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, #1a0f4c 0%, #05181c 100%); background-color:#05181c;"
      class="min-h-screen relative overflow-x-hidden font-outfit text-white">

    <div class="bg-orb bg-orb-1"></div>
    <div class="bg-orb bg-orb-2"></div>

    <%- include('../partials/navbar_app') %>

    <main class="relative z-10 mt-6">
        <div class="help-wrap">

            <a href="/room" class="btn-back">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <path d="M19 12H5M12 5l-7 7 7 7"/>
                </svg>
                Back to Room
            </a>

            <!-- Header -->
            <div class="help-header">
                <span class="help-eyebrow">✦ Help &amp; Guide</span>
                <h1 class="help-title">How Scriptorium works</h1>
                <p class="help-subtitle">
                    Scriptorium is your personal space for the media that matters to you — books, films, and music.
                    Not a streaming platform. You save what you discover, reflect on what you've experienced, and track how it connects to your growth.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Your room -->
            <div class="help-section">
                <div class="help-section-header">
                    <div class="help-section-icon">🏠</div>
                    <h2 class="help-section-title">Your Room</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="help-body">
                    <p>When you log in, you land in your <strong>3D room</strong>. This is your home base. Hold the left mouse button and drag to look around, and scroll to zoom in and out.</p>
                    <p>The room has three clickable spots — hover over them to see them glow, then single-click to enter:</p>
                </div>
                <ul class="room-spots">
                    <li class="room-spot">
                        <span class="room-spot-icon">📚</span>
                        The <strong>bookshelf</strong>
                        <span class="room-spot-arrow">→ Library</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="room-spot">
                        <span class="room-spot-icon">🎵</span>
                        The <strong>speakers</strong>
                        <span class="room-spot-arrow">→ Music Room</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="room-spot">
                        <span class="room-spot-icon">🎬</span>
                        The <strong>screen</strong>
                        <span class="room-spot-arrow">→ Theatre</span>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Inside each room -->
            <div class="help-section">
                <div class="help-section-header">
                    <div class="help-section-icon">🗂️</div>
                    <h2 class="help-section-title">Inside each room</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="help-body">
                    <p>Once you're in a room, you'll see your <strong>shelves</strong> — items you've saved, organised by status: <span class="hl">Wishlist</span>, <span class="hl">Reading / Watching / Listening</span>, <span class="hl">Finished</span> and <span class="hl">Favourites</span>.</p>
                    <p>Click any item on a shelf to see your reflections on it. You can also move items between shelves using the <strong>Move</strong> button, or mark them as done.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Search -->
            <div class="help-section">
                <div class="help-section-header">
                    <div class="help-section-icon">🔍</div>
                    <h2 class="help-section-title">Finding and saving media</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="help-body">
                    <p>Use the <span class="hl">search bar</span> in the top navigation to find anything — a book, a film, a track. Switch between <strong>Books</strong>, <strong>Music</strong> and <strong>Movies</strong> using the tabs on the results page.</p>
                    <p>When you find something, click <strong>Save to shelf</strong> and pick where it goes. It will appear in the matching room straight away.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Reflections -->
            <div class="help-section">
                <div class="help-section-header">
                    <div class="help-section-icon">✍️</div>
                    <h2 class="help-section-title">Reflections</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="help-body">
                    <p>A reflection is a short note you write about a piece of media. Go to <span class="hl">Reflections</span> from the navbar (the pencil icon), pick an item from your shelves using the dropdown, choose your mood, and write. Minimum 30 characters.</p>
                    <p>Not sure where to start? Hit <strong>Templates</strong> for guided prompts — things like First Impressions, Emotional Journey, or Would I Recommend.</p>
                    <p>The <strong>History panel</strong> on the right shows your recent reflections. Click any card to read it in full, or hit <strong>View Full History</strong> to see everything.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Goals -->
            <div class="help-section">
                <div class="help-section-header">
                    <div class="help-section-icon">🎯</div>
                    <h2 class="help-section-title">Goals &amp; Progress</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="help-body">
                    <p>Set a goal tied to a piece of media — for example, finishing a book or watching a series. Head to the <span class="hl">Progress</span> page from the navbar.</p>
                    <p>Drag the <strong>progress bar</strong> left or right to update how far you've gotten. When you hit 100%, the goal is marked complete and you earn a completion bonus.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Streaks -->
            <div class="help-section">
                <div class="help-section-header">
                    <div class="help-section-icon">🔥</div>
                    <h2 class="help-section-title">Daily streaks</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="help-body">
                    <p>Write a reflection <strong>or</strong> update a goal once a day to keep your streak alive. The longer your streak, the more badges you unlock. Check your streak on the <span class="hl">Rewards</span> page.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Yarns -->
            <div class="help-section">
                <div class="help-section-header">
                    <div class="help-section-icon">🧶</div>
                    <h2 class="help-section-title">Yarns &amp; Rewards</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="help-body">
                    <p>Every action earns you <span class="hl-gold">yarns</span> — the in-app currency. Check your balance and badge collection on the <span class="hl">Rewards</span> page.</p>
                </div>
                <table class="yarn-table">
                    <tr><td>Writing a reflection</td><td>+10 🧶</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>Updating goal progress</td><td>+5 🧶</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>Completing a goal</td><td>+25 🧶</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>Hitting a 7-day streak</td><td>+15 🧶</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>Earning a badge</td><td>+20 🧶</td></tr>
                </table>
            </div>

            <!-- Customise -->
            <div class="help-section">
                <div class="help-section-header">
                    <div class="help-section-icon">🐧</div>
                    <h2 class="help-section-title">Customise</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="help-body">
                    <p>Spend your yarns in the <span class="hl">Customise</span> page to unlock new animal avatars for your profile. Your avatar shows in the navigation bar and on your rewards screen. Rarer avatars cost more — start with the basics and work your way up.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </main>

</body>
</html>